# 10. Final safe disposition

## 10.1 Verdict and authority boundary

10.1.1 the subject root remained unchanged and is reviewed exactly as the 729-line/50109-byte snapshot identified in §1.1.

10.1.2 the 64-row manifest is structurally promising but security-semantically insufficient. Its current status must remain `NOT-FROZEN; NOT-INDEPENDENTLY-ACCEPTED; NOT-ACCEPTED`.

10.1.3 Review C does not become part of the subject root, does not self-authorize a successor, does not issue VetoSet or DefinitionAcceptance and cannot be counted as a Task leaf or Product progress.

10.1.4 safe terminal=`REJECT`; all 20 findings remain open; Gate29 and the development freeze remain unchanged.
